-- (d): "a registered charity, a governor of a registered charity, the tribunal and the court".
#ASSERT `Art 11(6)(d) the paragraph binds the party` `a registered charity`
#ASSERT `Art 11(6)(d) the paragraph binds the party` `a governor`
#ASSERT `Art 11(6)(d) the paragraph binds the party` `the Charity Tribunal`
#ASSERT `Art 11(6)(d) the paragraph binds the party` `the court`
#ASSERT NOT `Art 11(6)(d) the paragraph binds the party` `the Commissioner`
