§§ `Article 11(7) -- further grounds of refusal`

-- EXPECT: STANDING
#TRACE `Art 11(7) the States may prescribe further grounds on which an application must or may be refused` AT 0 WITH
    (`WAIT UNTIL` 365)

-- EXPECT: FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 11(7) the States may prescribe further grounds on which an application must or may be refused` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the States` DOES (`Act under Article 11` OF `the States`, `make Regulations prescribing further grounds on which an application must or may be refused`) AT 100

-- (a) "that the entity has only one governor, not being a person who, by way of acting as a governor, carries on a prescribed description of regulated financial services business or any other prescribed description of business".
#ASSERT `Art 11(7)(a) the entity has only one governor who does not carry on a prescribed description of business as a governor` `a Jersey company with one governor` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `Art 11(7)(a) the entity has only one governor who does not carry on a prescribed description of business as a governor` `a Jersey company with one governor` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `Art 11(7)(a) the entity has only one governor who does not carry on a prescribed description of business as a governor` `a Jersey company that has applied` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `Art 11(7)(a) the entity has only one governor who does not carry on a prescribed description of business as a governor` `a Jersey company with no governor` FALSE
-- (b) "that a number or proportion of its governors are related to each other in prescribed ways": the number, proportion and ways are in Regulations, so the test is an input.
#ASSERT `Art 11(7)(b) a number or proportion of the governors are related to each other in prescribed ways` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `Art 11(7)(b) a number or proportion of the governors are related to each other in prescribed ways` FALSE

§§ `Article 11(9) -- certificates of registration`

`the charity that has been registered` MEANS `Registered charity` WITH
    entity IS `a Jersey company that is a registered charity`
    `registration number` IS "JC-2026-001"
    `registered name` IS "Hope Foundation Limited"
    `alternative registered names` IS EMPTY
    `date registered` IS YMD 2026 4 2
    `date deregistered` IS NOTHING
    `registered charitable purposes` IS EMPTY
    `registered public benefit statement` IS "Relief of poverty in Jersey"
    `is an organized religious charity` IS FALSE

-- (a) on registering, a certificate confirming the registered name, the registration number and the date of registration.
-- EXPECT: STANDING
#TRACE `Art 11(9)(a) the Commissioner must issue a certificate of registration` TRUE `the charity that has been registered` AT 0 WITH
    (`WAIT UNTIL` 60)

-- EXPECT: FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 11(9)(a) the Commissioner must issue a certificate of registration` TRUE `the charity that has been registered` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the Commissioner` DOES (`Act under Article 11` OF `the Commissioner`, (`issue a certificate of registration` "Hope Foundation Limited" "JC-2026-001" (YMD 2026 4 2))) AT 10

-- A certificate that confirms a different number is not the certificate the paragraph requires: the duty stands.
-- EXPECT: STANDING
#TRACE `Art 11(9)(a) the Commissioner must issue a certificate of registration` TRUE `the charity that has been registered` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the Commissioner` DOES (`Act under Article 11` OF `the Commissioner`, (`issue a certificate of registration` "Hope Foundation Limited" "JC-2026-999" (YMD 2026 4 2))) AT 10

-- EXPECT: FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 11(9)(a) the Commissioner must issue a certificate of registration` FALSE `the charity that has been registered` AT 0 WITH
    (`WAIT UNTIL` 60)

-- (b) on entering a new or alternative registered name under Article 12(5), a further certificate confirming that name and the date on which it was entered.
-- EXPECT: STANDING
#TRACE `Art 11(9)(b) the Commissioner must issue a further certificate for a new or alternative registered name` TRUE "Hope Trust" (YMD 2026 9 1) AT 0 WITH
    (`WAIT UNTIL` 60)

-- EXPECT: FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 11(9)(b) the Commissioner must issue a further certificate for a new or alternative registered name` TRUE "Hope Trust" (YMD 2026 9 1) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the Commissioner` DOES (`Act under Article 11` OF `the Commissioner`, (`issue a further certificate for a new or alternative registered name` "Hope Trust" (YMD 2026 9 1))) AT 10

-- EXPECT: STANDING
#TRACE `Art 11(9)(b) the Commissioner must issue a further certificate for a new or alternative registered name` TRUE "Hope Trust" (YMD 2026 9 1) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the Commissioner` DOES (`Act under Article 11` OF `the Commissioner`, (`issue a further certificate for a new or alternative registered name` "Hope Trust" (YMD 2026 9 2))) AT 10

-- EXPECT: FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 11(9)(b) the Commissioner must issue a further certificate for a new or alternative registered name` FALSE "Hope Trust" (YMD 2026 9 1) AT 0 WITH
    (`WAIT UNTIL` 60)
